<title>JAPAN: Japan shares named in option lists gain ground.</title>
<headline>Japan shares named in option lists gain ground.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in companies that received approval on Monday to list stock options on the Tokyo and Osaka exchanges later this year gained ground in early Tuesday trade, traders said.</p>
<p>As of 0031 GMT, shares in Sega Enterprises Ltd were up 60 yen at 3,920, Seven-Eleven Japan Co Ltd was 120 yen higher at 8,930 and Nintendo Co Ltd was up 70 yen at 8,890.</p>
</text>
